ombie mode you can earn golds per kill!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/817250/extras/a13679daa4233accdd5702017e3a97d9.poster.avif?t=1696715693\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/817250/extras/a13679daa4233accdd5702017e3a97d9.webm?t=1696715693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/817250/extras/a13679daa4233accdd5702017e3a97d9.mp4?t=1696715693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
